{"act": 2, "action": "projects.charter", "actor": "e2e", "at": "2026-11-21T17:36:15+00:00", "input": {"charter": "# Charter \u2014 S01 UI spike (retrospective, 2026-11-21)\n\n## Mandate\n\nDecide by measurement whether `conveyor`'s UI is Leptos CSR/WASM or SSR, and record the decision as\nan ADR with the numbers that decided it.\n\n## Scope\n\nOne fixture server, the board and chat screens built twice (CSR and SSR), minimum auth as planned.\nOut: the production UI (S12); the spike workspace was deleted after the ADR.\n\n## Expected outputs\n\n`project-brief`, `evidence`.\n\n## Closure outputs\n\n`decision` \u2014 the retrospective decision record: ADR 0001 plus the statement of what is observable\nnow and what is not recoverable.\n\n## Benefit\n\nB1 (auditable decisions): the UI stack is decided by measurement, not preference.\n\n## Tranche\n\n0 (closed). The spike workspace (`spikes/web`) was deleted after the ADR; the decision and the\nmeasured numbers stand, and the values that were never measured are marked not recoverable.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nThe decision record states what is observable and marks the rest not recoverable; the project\nre-closes through the one gate.\n", "project_id": "01a1d039-0d27-724c-9bae-af96b2d926b1"}, "result_id": null}
