{"act": 3, "action": "projects.close_request", "actor": "e2e", "at": "2026-11-21T17:42:43+00:00", "input": {"closure": "# Closure \u2014 S01 UI spike (retrospective, 2026-11-21)\n\n## Outcome\n\nThe UI stack is decided: **Leptos CSR/WASM**. The prior held \u2014 SSR did not beat CSR on interaction TTI\n(5,736 ms vs 5,426 ms, throttled, median n=5) and the auth flow did not force cookie-based SSR. The\ndecision is recorded in `docs/decisions/0001-ui-stack.md`.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- ADR 0001 with its measured table\n- the acceptance manifest run at the branch SHA\n- the slice plan `docs/plans/slices/S01-ui-spike.md`\n\n## Decision\n\nClose S01 as a reworked decision project. The old closure row remains; this record supersedes it. The\nspike workspace was deleted after the ADR, so metrics 5\u20137 (SSE\u2192DOM, the 5-minute memory soak, and the\nfull SSR cold-build set) are **not recoverable**; the record says which, and does not claim them.\n\n## Open items\n\nNone: a re-run of the spike would be a new project, and S12 builds on the decision.\n", "delegation_ref": "01a1ff1f-e4ba-72dc-9c1a-13049933cf14", "evidence": {"manifest": "acceptance/programme/S01.toml", "retrospective": true, "sha": "d7293f96082dbf2f99f53bb8fd765834dddf6858"}, "id": "01a1d039-0d27-724c-9bae-af96b2d926b1"}, "result_id": null}
